{"type":"after","callId":"call@399","endTime":55485.166,"result":{"value":"C\nCHURVOX\nCOMMAND DESK\nAI OPERATOR\nPrepared admin. You approve.\n\nCOMMAND\n\nCM\nCommand Board\n\nWORK\n\nJB\nJobs\nDP\nCrew Dispatch\nCL\nClients\nQT\nQuotes\nIV\nInvoices\n\nCREW & ADMIN\n\nTM\nTeam\nPR\nPayroll\nRP\nReports\n\nSYSTEM\n\nPL\nPlans\nST\nSettings\n?\nSupport\nJOB WORKBENCH\nJobs\n\nPick a real job from the side, edit it here, then save, invoice, or prepare the next action from this page.\n\nQUICK LIST\nJobs\nRefresh\nView full job list\n\nNo records yet. Create the first one in the form.\n\nJOBS DIRECT FORM\nJOB TITLE\nCLIENT\nJOB ADDRESS\nSCHEDULE/DATE\nWORKER\nChoose worker\nTest Worker\nHoward Jennings\nJOB STATUS\nassigned\nin_progress\ncompleted\nneeds_review\ncancelled\nPRICING TYPE\nFixed price\nHourly\nFixed + extras\nHourly + extras\nPRICE / RATE\nRECURRING\nNo\nWeekly\nFortnightly\nMonthly\nCustom\nPHOTOS REQUIRED\nNot required\nAfter photo\nBefore and after\nGPS/SITE CHECK\nNot required\nStart check\nCompletion check\nStart and completion\nCUSTOMER-VISIBLE NOTE\nWORKER INSTRUCTIONS\nOWNER-ONLY NOTE\nOwner controls\n\nPick a real record on the side, or create a new one here.\n\nSave edit\nSave job\nClear / new item\nEMPLOYER FIELD ACTIVITY\nWhat the crew has done\n\nLoading...\nNo worker field activity yet. Worker starts, finishes, photos and notes will show here."},"afterSnapshot":"after@call@399"}
