{"type":"after","callId":"call@447","endTime":65854.939,"result":{"value":"C\nCHURVOX\nCOMMAND DESK\nAI OPERATOR\nPrepared admin. You approve.\n\nCOMMAND\n\nCM\nCommand Board\n\nWORK\n\nJB\nJobs\nDP\nCrew Dispatch\nCL\nClients\nQT\nQuotes\nIV\nInvoices\n\nCREW & ADMIN\n\nTM\nTeam\nPR\nPayroll\nRP\nReports\n\nSYSTEM\n\nPL\nPlans\nST\nSettings\n?\nSupport\nBUILD DIRECT-WORKBENCH-SIDEBAR-CLEAR\nINVOICE WORKBENCH\nInvoices\n\nPick a real invoice or prepare a new one, choose who handles delivery, then approve it. No silent customer email, no fake Xero sync, no active MYOB wording.\n\nQUICK LIST\n\nNo invoices yet. Create the first one in the form.\n\nSPECIFIC WORKING FORM\nInvoice delivery\nDRAFT ONLY\nApproved as a draft only. Nothing is sent, emailed, or synced.\nCLIENT\nCLIENT EMAIL\nJOB / INVOICE REFERENCE\nINVOICE TYPE\nJob invoice\nDeposit invoice\nExtras\nTime-based\nAdjustment\nINVOICE DELIVERY METHOD\nChurvox internal\nXero\nDraft only\nManual external\nMYOB staged/later (inactive)\nAMOUNT\nGST STATUS\nGST included\nGST excluded\nNo GST\nNeeds check\nGST RATE\nPAYMENT LINK\nNot included\nIncluded\nComing soon\nNeeds setup\nDUE DATE\nINVOICE WORDING\nINTERNAL NOTE\nOwner controls\n\nLoaded invoices through fallback route. Repair business records if anything is missing.\n\nSave edit\nApprove invoice delivery\nClear / new invoice"},"afterSnapshot":"after@call@447"}
