{"type":"after","callId":"call@462","endTime":74029.271,"result":{"value":"C\nCHURVOX\nCOMMAND DESK\nAI OPERATOR\nPrepared admin. You approve.\n\nCOMMAND\n\nCM\nCommand Board\n\nWORK\n\nJB\nJobs\nDP\nCrew Dispatch\nCL\nClients\nQT\nQuotes\nIV\nInvoices\n\nCREW & ADMIN\n\nTM\nTeam\nPR\nPayroll\nRP\nReports\n\nSYSTEM\n\nPL\nPlans\nST\nSettings\n?\nSupport\nBUILD DIRECT-WORKBENCH-SIDEBAR-CLEAR\nDISPATCH WORKBENCH\nCrew dispatch\n\nPick a real job, select a worker, set the schedule and prepare the worker note without opening another page.\n\nQUICK LIST\nCrew dispatch\nRefresh\nView full job list\n\nNo records yet. Create the first one in the form.\n\nCREW DISPATCH DIRECT FORM\nEXISTING JOB ID\nJOB TITLE\nCLIENT / SITE\nWORKER\nChoose worker\nTest Worker\nHoward Jennings\nWORKER ID\nBACKUP WORKER\nChoose worker\nTest Worker\nHoward Jennings\nSCHEDULED DATE/TIME\nASSIGNMENT STATUS\nAssign now\nOffer to worker\nHold\nNeeds schedule check\nWORKER ACKNOWLEDGEMENT\nRequired\nNot required\nAsk worker to confirm\nACCESS/SITE NOTES\nCUSTOMER-VISIBLE ARRIVAL NOTE\nWORKER DISPATCH NOTE\nOwner controls\n\nPick a real record on the side, or create a new one here.\n\nSave edit\nAssign / save dispatch\nClear / new item\nEMPLOYER FIELD ACTIVITY\nWhat the crew has done\n\nLoading...\nNo worker field activity yet. Worker starts, finishes, photos and notes will show here."},"afterSnapshot":"after@call@462"}
