{"type":"after","callId":"call@493","endTime":84750.655,"result":{"value":"C\nCHURVOX\nCOMMAND DESK\nAI OPERATOR\nPrepared admin. You approve.\n\nCOMMAND\n\nCM\nCommand Board\n\nWORK\n\nJB\nJobs\nDP\nCrew Dispatch\nCL\nClients\nQT\nQuotes\nIV\nInvoices\n\nCREW & ADMIN\n\nTM\nTeam\nPR\nPayroll\nRP\nReports\n\nSYSTEM\n\nPL\nPlans\nST\nSettings\n?\nSupport\nBUILD DIRECT-WORKBENCH-SIDEBAR-CLEAR\nPAYROLL WORKBENCH\nPayroll/time\n\nPick job time from the side, review hours, adjustments and payroll notes here.\n\nQUICK LIST\nPayroll/time\nRefresh\nView full time record list\n\nNo records yet. Create the first one in the form.\n\nPAYROLL/TIME DIRECT FORM\nJOB ID\nWORKER\nChoose worker\nTest Worker\nHoward Jennings\nPAY PERIOD\nPAY TYPE\nHourly\nFixed\nManual adjustment\nUnpaid review\nREVIEWED HOURS\nPAUSE TIME\nADJUSTMENT TIME/AMOUNT\nADJUSTMENT REASON\nAPPROVAL STATUS\nNeeds review\nApproved by owner\nApproved by payroll\nHold\nExported\nPAYROLL STATUS\nReady\nNeeds review\nHold\nExported\nPAYROLL NOTE\nEXPORT / HANDOFF NOTE\nOwner controls\n\nPick a real record on the side, or create a new one here.\n\nSave edit\nSave payroll review\nClear / new item\nEMPLOYER FIELD ACTIVITY\nWhat the crew has done\n\nLoading...\nNo worker field activity yet. Worker starts, finishes, photos and notes will show here."},"afterSnapshot":"after@call@493"}
