{"type":"after","callId":"call@774","endTime":181347.593,"result":{"value":"CM\nCommand\nJB\nJobs\nDP\nDispatch\nCL\nClients\nQT\nQuotes\nIV\nInvoices\nTM\nTeam\nPL\nPlans\nST\nSettings\nBILLING COUNTRY\nShow prices for New Zealand\nNew Zealand · NZD + GST\nAustralia · AUD + GST\nUnited States · USD\nUnited Kingdom · GBP + VAT\n\nShowing NZD fixed local pricing. Stripe needs matching country Price IDs so checkout charges the same local amount.\n\nCURRENT PLAN\nCommand\nBILLING COUNTRY\nNew Zealand · NZD\nTRIAL\nTrial status not set\nAPP ACCESS\nAllowed\nSTART\nStart\nNZ$39\n/month + GST\n\nFor solo operators getting organised.\n\n✓\nJobs and clients\n✓\nQuotes and invoices\n✓\nBasic scheduling\n✓\nBasic AI admin help\n✓\nUp to 20 active clients\nChoose Start\nCREW\nCrew\nNZ$89\n/month + GST\n\nFor small crews that need control.\n\n✓\nEverything in Start\n✓\nTeam workflow\n✓\nWorker assignments\n✓\nTime tracking\n✓\nUp to 30 active clients\nChoose Crew\nRECOMMENDED\nOPERATOR\nOperator\nNZ$149\n/month + GST\n\nChurvox does the admin. You approve.\n\n✓\nEverything in Crew\n✓\nAI Operator Actions\n✓\nApproval queue\n✓\nAdvanced job admin\n✓\nXero add-on available\n✓\nUp to 40 active clients\nChoose Operator\nCURRENT\nCommand\nNZ$299\n/month + GST\n\nFull command centre for larger teams.\n\n✓\nEverything in Operator\n✓\nUp to 50 active clients\n✓\nUp to 50 active team members\n✓\nXero support\n✓\nPayroll workspace\n✓\nAdvanced roles\n✓\nReports and exports\nCurrent plan\nACCOUNTING ADD-ON\nXero add-on\nNZ$39 /month + GST\n\nOptional Xero support for Operator. Included with Command.\n\nStatus: Not active\nAdd Xero\nSCALE ADD-ON\nCommand Growth Pack\nNZ$99 /month + GST\n\nAdd more crew, more jobs and more AI Operator capacity as your business grows.\n\nActive blocks: 0 · Extra team: 0\nAdd Growth Pack\nPRICING NOTES\nOperator is the main selling plan.\nPrices are monthly and shown in NZD.\nTax shown as + GST where applicable.\nSMS credits and Growth Packs can be added when