{"type":"after","callId":"call@1039","endTime":271551.55,"result":{"value":"CM\nCommand\nJB\nJobs\nDP\nDispatch\nCL\nClients\nQT\nQuotes\nIV\nInvoices\nTM\nTeam\nPL\nPlans\nST\nSettings\nSETTINGS\nSet the business up once. Keep it clean.\n\nBusiness profile and branding now save to the backend so invoices, quotes and customer messages can use the same real details.\n\nBusiness profile\nBUSINESS NAME\nTRADING NAME\nBUSINESS EMAIL\nBUSINESS PHONE\nWEBSITE\nBUSINESS ADDRESS\nGST NUMBER\nNZBN\nINVOICE PREFIX\nQUOTE PREFIX\nCUSTOMER TONE\nWORKING HOURS\nDEFAULT CUSTOMER MESSAGE\nINVOICE / QUOTE FOOTER\nOwner controls\n\nBusiness profile loaded from backend.\n\nSave business profile\nReload profile\nXERO CONNECTION\nXero setup\n\nXero has two separate steps: the paid add-on, then the owner OAuth connection. Churvox never asks for a Xero password.\n\nShow sync rules\nADD-ON BILLING\nNot active\nDEVELOPER SETUP\nMissing Render env\nXERO CONNECTION\nNot connected\nRender needs XERO_CLIENT_ID, XERO_CLIENT_SECRET and XERO_REDIRECT_URI before Connect Xero can work.\nConnect Xero\nSave sync settings\nDisconnect Xero\nINVOICE SYNC\n\nOnly approved invoices are staged. No fake sync and no silent customer email.\n\nPAYMENT STATUS\n\nPayment status can be pulled back for owner review when Xero is connected.\n\nPAYROLL HANDOFF\n\nApproved hours only. No bank payout, tax decision, or government submission.\n\nPAYROLL SAFETY\n\nChurvox can prepare approved hours/timesheets for Xero Payroll handoff later. It will not create bank payouts, tax decisions, or government submissions."},"afterSnapshot":"after@call@1039"}
